    "summary": "Astra single-pass personal visual reading of all 18 original pages and all final no-snap crops. Restore all ten scanned official-key sheets, including alternative methods and extra printed passages; native A–E sections retain the original whole p1. No separate model checker. Prior inherited transcription stored separately; no inherited adjudicator.",
