    "sourceDiscrepancies": [
      "PDF T1 is primary. Photographed 1_1 uses u instead of PDF v; 1_2 uses numbered B parts rather than letters; 1_4 loses the less-than-or-equal glyph; 1_5 renders magnetic field as mT and resistance unit W instead of PDF microtesla and ohm. These variants remain bound as original supplements, without replacing intact PDF units.",
      "Key B labels its numerical example (d), although question labels it (c). Preserved.",
      "Key A final arctangent expression does not specify branch/add pi; earlier sine/cosine forms and original expression all retained.",
      "Key C repeats the ratio table/passage; its iteration discussion says right-hand -1 has little effect and later drops a -1/add-one in second iteration. Preserved literally, not recalculated.",
      "Key D includes additional (c) cobalt binding-energy/radius calculation absent from both supplied question editions; retained as source-key content only, no invented question. Sheet 1_sol8 ends with the E numerical time calculation, repeated later in E; retained in original order.",
      "Key E method2 induced-current line lacks omega and integration line lacks minus sign present in preceding differential equation; all retained as printed."
